00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.810
So, what do you mean about that?

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.700
- Well, I think my first couple of records

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:30.180
were about heartbreaks and
I was a dramatic 20 year old

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.013
going through...
- Me too.

00:05:31.013 --> 00:05:32.490
- Heartbreaks and stuff like that.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.310
