00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.360
it can't be joyful all the time.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:45.420
But like, stepping into a confidence

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.360
and I, because heartbreak
was a safe space for me,

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.060
so I've been like, playing
with different emotions,

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.970
anger, sexiness, joyfulness.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.190
And it's, it's, it's really exciting

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.680
and I feel like I'm in
a dangerous place again.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.930
And as an artist, I like
to feel a bit scared.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:01.763
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:01.763 --> 00:06:02.596
- Before I release music,

00:06:02.596 --> 00:06:04.440
