something right, I think.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:05.273
- Ooh.

00:06:05.273 --> 00:06:07.110
(audience applauds)
(Sam chuckles)

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:09.120
I'm gonna listen to my album again.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.500
I was just thinking to myself.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.360
So wait, did that change
your songwriting process?

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.850
Because I feel like it's very easy for me,

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.440
