00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.340
all right there and I need to get it out.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.830
But it, it's harder for
me to write I think,

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:28.650
or it has been in the
past, to write positively.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.483
Like, you know?

00:06:29.483 --> 00:06:30.983
So, is that, is, which
one's easier for you?

00:06:30.983 --> 00:06:31.816
- I mean, do you know what?

00:06:31.816 --> 00:06:33.240
I can, I tried to write happy songs

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.160
