00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:45.686
I'm feeling, I like my
body, I like my life, I'm...

00:06:45.686 --> 00:06:46.519
- Yeah.

00:06:46.519 --> 00:06:49.195
- I'm turning 30 and thirty's fabulous.

00:06:49.195 --> 00:06:50.354
- [Kelly] I love that.
(audience applauds)

00:06:50.354 --> 00:06:51.187
- And aging is fabulous.
(audience applauds)

00:06:51.187 --> 00:06:52.382
