00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.240
Like, a lot of people don't make it.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.530
You know, we all
unfortunately have friends

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.030
that have, or family that haven't made it

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.970
and it's like, "I'm not
gonna down these wrinkles".

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:15.150
Like, I'm proud that I got to
live this long to have them.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.920
You know? Like, not everybody does.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.500
